      "name": "NAW FAQ",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"nawfaq\">\n  <div class=\"nawfaq__inner\">\n\n    <header class=\"nawfaq__head\">\n      <span class=\"nawfaq__eyebrow\">Help Centre</span>\n      <h1 class=\"nawfaq__title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n      <p class=\"nawfaq__sub\">Everything you need to know before you buy a bundle. Still stuck? Message us &mdash; a real person replies.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"nawfaq__list\">\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">Are you legit?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>We started in the world of vintage back in 2015, then launched the wholesale company in 2023 &mdash; and we&rsquo;ve been going strong since. With nearly 10,000 website orders locked in, we&rsquo;re now one of the UK&rsquo;s leading suppliers of used and vintage clothing.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">What types of clothing do you offer?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>A wide range of vintage from every era &mdash; &rsquo;80s, &rsquo;90s, Y2K and modern &mdash; with styles from casual wear to high fashion. Our inventory mixes both men&rsquo;s and women&rsquo;s clothing, so there&rsquo;s something for all shapes and sizes.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">Do you offer handpick?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>No, we don&rsquo;t offer handpicking. We keep the grading process fair and consistent for all of our online customers, so everyone gets an equal selection of quality items. For larger customers, we can accommodate specific requests and tailor bigger bulk orders.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">How do you source the product?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>We source our vintage from trusted suppliers all over the world &mdash; from the USA to Asia and everywhere in between. Every piece is carefully inspected and chosen for quality, authenticity and style, so we can cater to all kinds of business while keeping the operation lean and on-trend.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">Can I see the product before buying?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>We don&rsquo;t provide individual photos of every item in a bundle, but we do include an example video so you know what to expect. Want to see a specific product first? Message us on Instagram and we&rsquo;ll send a video before you buy.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">How do I know the quality of the items?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>We inspect all bundle stock before it&rsquo;s listed, checking authenticity, condition and any imperfections. We don&rsquo;t heavily alter or repair items, but we make sure they&rsquo;re in good wearable condition &mdash; and we offer a washing service to make life easier and improve the grade. See our <a href=\"/pages/grading-system\">grading page</a> for exactly what to expect.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">Do you accept returns?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>Due to the nature of vintage, we typically don&rsquo;t accept returns or exchanges on wholesale orders unless items are damaged or incorrect. If you receive any defective or incorrect pieces, contact us within 7 days of delivery and we&rsquo;ll help put it right. For full detail, see our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">refund policy</a>.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"nawfaq__item\">\n        <summary class=\"nawfaq__q\">How quickly can you dispatch?</summary>\n        <div class=\"nawfaq__a\"><p>Our warehouse is open 9&ndash;5, Monday to Friday. Bundles ordered before <strong>11am</strong> are sent the same day; anything after 11am goes the next working day. Washing bundles take 2&ndash;5 days to process at our facility.</p></div>\n      </details>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nawfaq__cta\">\n      <div class=\"nawfaq__cta-text\">\n        <p class=\"nawfaq__cta-h\">Still have questions?</p>\n        <p class=\"nawfaq__cta-s\">Our team is on hand 9&ndash;5, Monday to Friday &mdash; happy to help before you buy.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/pages/contact\" class=\"nawfaq__cta-btn\">Contact Us</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .nawfaq{\n    font-family:'Poppins',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    background:#fff;color:#1a1a1a;\n    padding:8px 0 8px;\n  }\n  .nawfaq *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .nawfaq__inner{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}\n\n  .nawfaq__head{text-align:center;margin:0 0 34px}\n  .nawfaq__eyebrow{\n    display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;\n    text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6b6b;margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .nawfaq__title{\n    font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,46px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;\n    line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 12px;color:#111;text-wrap:balance;\n  }\n  .nawfaq__sub{\n    font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#6b6b6b;margin:0 auto;max-width:52ch;\n  }\n\n  .nawfaq__list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n\n  .nawfaq__item{\n    background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\n    transition:border-color .2s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1),box-shadow .2s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);\n  }\n  .nawfaq__item[open]{border:2px solid #111}\n  @media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){\n    .nawfaq__item:not([open]):hover{border-color:#c9c9c9}\n  }\n\n  .nawfaq__q{\n    list-style:none;cursor:pointer;position:relative;\n    padding:19px 56px 19px 22px;\n    font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#111;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\n    user-select:none;\n  }\n  .nawfaq__q::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .nawfaq__q::after{\n    content:'';position:absolute;right:22px;top:50%;\n    width:13px;height:13px;margin-top:-6.5px;flex-shrink:0;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(#111,#111) center/13px 2px no-repeat,\n      linear-gradient(#111,#111) center/2px 13px no-repeat;\n    transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);\n  }\n  .nawfaq__item[open] .nawfaq__q::after{transform:rotate(135deg)}\n\n  .nawfaq__a{padding:0 22px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.72;color:#3a3a3a}\n  .nawfaq__item[open] .nawfaq__a{padding-left:21px;padding-right:21px}\n  .nawfaq__a p{margin:0}\n  .nawfaq__a a{color:#111;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:500}\n  .nawfaq__a a:hover{color:#000}\n  .nawfaq__a strong{color:#111;font-weight:600}\n\n  .nawfaq__cta{\n    margin-top:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;\n    background:#fdfbf7;border:2px solid #111;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;\n  }\n  .nawfaq__cta-text{min-width:0}\n  .nawfaq__cta-h{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#111;letter-spacing:-0.01em}\n  .nawfaq__cta-s{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;color:#6b6b6b;line-height:1.5}\n  .nawfaq__cta-btn{\n    flex-shrink:0;display:inline-block;background:#111;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\n    font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;\n    padding:14px 26px;border-radius:8px;transition:transform .15s,opacity .15s;white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n  .nawfaq__cta-btn:hover{opacity:.88}\n  .nawfaq__cta-btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}\n\n  @media (max-width:560px){\n    .nawfaq__cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left}\n    .nawfaq__cta-btn{width:100%;text-align:center}\n    .nawfaq__q{font-size:15px;padding:17px 50px 17px 18px}\n    .nawfaq__a{padding:0 18px 18px}\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .nawfaq__item,.nawfaq__q::after,.nawfaq__cta-btn{transition:none}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are you legit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We started in vintage in 2015 and launched the wholesale company in 2023. With nearly 10,000 website orders, we are now one of the UK's leading suppliers of used and vintage clothing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What types of clothing do you offer?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A wide range of vintage from every era including the 80s, 90s, Y2K and modern, with styles from casual wear to high fashion, in a mix of men's and women's clothing across all shapes and sizes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you offer handpick?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, we do not offer handpicking. We keep the grading process fair and consistent for all online customers. For larger customers we can accommodate specific requests on bulk orders.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you source the product?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We source our vintage from trusted suppliers around the world, from the USA to Asia. Each piece is inspected and chosen for its quality, authenticity and style.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I see the product before buying?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We do not provide individual photos of each item, but we include an example video so you know what to expect. Message us on Instagram for a video of a specific product before purchasing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I know the quality of the items?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We inspect all bundle stock before listing, checking authenticity, condition and imperfections to ensure items are in good wearable condition. We also offer a washing service. See our grading page for what to expect.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you accept returns?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Due to the nature of vintage, we typically do not accept returns or exchanges on wholesale orders unless items are damaged or incorrect. If you receive defective or incorrect pieces, contact us within 7 days and we will help resolve it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How quickly can you dispatch?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our warehouse is open 9-5 Monday to Friday. Bundles are sent the same day if placed before 11am; orders after 11am are sent the next working day. Washing bundles take 2-5 days to process.\"}}]}\n</script>",
